<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0630_T30FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t BUY Narcan, but it fully\nbring back a fainted homie. Miracle\fdrug.\rIt don’t restore PP though. Back from\nthe dead but outta ammo.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0630_T30FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Max OppSpray keep weak homies away\nthe longest. I spray it on my front\fdoor.\fKeeps the in-laws away too.</language>
	</row>
</body>
